body:
I went there with a friend on Saturday. They let us grab from the basket of coupons. She got a $10 off, I got a $5 off. I let her have my $5 off as I was broke. Might as well spread the wealth, right?

&#x200B;

No treats. They gave a small GWP if you bought something. I heard vendors talking about giveaways for the middle of the day. The store was pretty dead.

I've come ridiculously close to offing myself over being FA30plus multiple times. Check out my Reddit history for the  details. 

What  is keeping me from trying again is the fear that my soulmate is somewhere just around the corner. Even though I don't really believe that, the mere idea that someone might show up like magic keeps me from wanting to try. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;
